[2026-09-30T20:50:52.667Z] INFO faser.utils_med: If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, help them sit upright with support, keep them calm by talking to them and asking simple questions. If the attack is severe or prolonged, call 999 for an ambulance. Avoid exposing them to cold air, as it can worsen the attack.

Remember not to give an adrenaline shot (epinephrine) unless specifically trained to do so and instructed, as incorrect administration can be harmful.
[2026-09-30T20:50:52.684Z] INFO faser: Generation 1/60 completed in 3.523s
[2026-09-30T20:50:52.717Z] INFO faser.utils_med: If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, help them sit upright with support, keep them calm by talking to them and asking simple questions. If the attack is severe or prolonged, call 999 for an ambulance. Avoid exposing them to cold air, as it can worsen the attack.

Remember not to give an adrenaline shot (epinephrine) unless specifically trained to do so and instructed, as incorrect administration can be harmful.
[2026-09-30T20:50:52.734Z] INFO faser.__main__: Answer:
If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, help them sit upright with support, keep them calm by talking to them and asking simple questions. If the attack is severe or prolonged, call 999 for an ambulance. Avoid exposing them to cold air, as it can worsen the attack.

Remember not to give an adrenaline shot (epinephrine) unless specifically trained to do so and instructed, as incorrect administration can be harmful.
