 Check their airway and breathing.  If they are breathing fi ne on their own, the 
airway is clear so there is no need to move the head back.  However, if need be 
you can use the ‘jaw thrust’ technique to keep the  airway open without moving 
the head ( this t echnique is explained on page 58 ).  Keep a close eye on their  
